{"page":220,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.5 • 연결지향형 트랜스포트 TCP","words":[{"text":"3.5","x":970,"y":147,"width":42,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":1045,"y":152,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"연결지향형","x":1092,"y":145,"width":128,"height":30},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1232,"y":146,"width":132,"height":29},{"text":"TCP","x":1387,"y":147,"width":62,"height":26}]},{"text":"다. 그리고 송신자와 수신자를 연결하는 채널의 복잡한(현실에 가까운) 모델을 다루기","words":[{"text":"다.","x":186,"y":275,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"그리고","x":240,"y":273,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"송신자와","x":356,"y":273,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"수신자를","x":503,"y":273,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"연결하는","x":650,"y":273,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"채널의","x":794,"y":274,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"복잡한(현실에","x":903,"y":274,"width":211,"height":38},{"text":"가까운)","x":1132,"y":274,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"모델을","x":1257,"y":273,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"다루기","x":1372,"y":274,"width":96,"height":37}]},{"text":"위해서 또는 프로토콜의 성능을 향상시기기 위해서 이들 메거니츰이 어떻게 추가되는","words":[{"text":"위해서","x":186,"y":334,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"또는","x":300,"y":337,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"프로토콜의","x":381,"y":335,"width":163,"height":36},{"text":"성능을","x":562,"y":334,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"향상시기기","x":674,"y":334,"width":158,"height":38},{"text":"위해서","x":851,"y":334,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"이들","x":963,"y":334,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"메거니츰이","x":1044,"y":334,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"어떻게","x":1226,"y":334,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"추가되는","x":1338,"y":334,"width":135,"height":37}]},{"text":"지에 대해서 살펴볼 것이다.","words":[{"text":"지에","x":186,"y":396,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"대해서","x":265,"y":396,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"살펴볼","x":378,"y":395,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":493,"y":394,"width":103,"height":38}]},{"text":"하위의 채널 모델에서 한 가지 남아 있는 가정을 고려하면서 신뢰적인 데이터 전","words":[{"text":"하위의","x":251,"y":457,"width":98,"height":38},{